WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.250
Every school says it values
making and building.

2
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:06.200
Far fewer can say what good
actually looks like.

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:11.550
The Open Making and Building Standard
is an open K–12 vocabulary

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.820
for the practices behind the projects.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.150
Five shared practices: Define, Draft,

6
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.000
Test, Iterate, Share.

7
00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.600
Four dimensions for making,
four for building.

8
00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.750
Every dimension progresses from
kindergarten through 12th grade,

9
00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:33.300
with crosswalks to NGSS,
Common Core and ISTE.

10
00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:36.800
And for families, one simple question:

11
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.600
What does making well look like
at my child's age?

12
00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
Pick a grade, move the slider,
read it in plain English.

13
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.200
Assess making and building
with confidence.

14
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.800
Try the parent tool at /demo.
